msgstr "关于波比 TV"

msgctxt "#32056"
msgid "Cannot connect to the player right now. Restart Kodi and check again."
msgstr "暂时无法连接播放器，请重启 Kodi 后再检查。"

msgctxt "#32057"
msgid "Player connection is ready for test playback. You can skip BT setup when using 115 or local libraries."
msgstr "播放器连接正常，可以选择视频试播。使用 115 或本地片库时，可跳过 BT 设置。"
